# The bigger taxonomy

I think your entire niche can be expressed as nine questions:

```text
DISCOVER
What exists?

CAPABILITY
Can it do what I need?

ECONOMICS
What will it cost?

AVAILABILITY
Does it currently work?

QUALITY
How well does it work?

TRUST
Who runs it and can I trust it?

POLICY
Am I permitted to use it?

PROVENANCE
Where did the information/result come from?

DECISION
Given all of the above, what should I do?
```

That's a much cleaner way to decide what APIs to batch-build.

